- ap-southeast-1: Assets are located outside China.', example='cn-hangzhou', position='Body'),
  traceId?: string(name='TraceId', description='The trace ID used to track service requests.', example='550e8400e29b41d4a71644665544****', position='Body'),
  turnId: string(name='TurnId', description='The conversation turn ID, obtained from the streaming response of CreateCopilotChat.

